<title>CHINA: China rice exports up 368.4 pct in Jan-June.</title>
<headline>China rice exports up 368.4 pct in Jan-June.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>China exported 360,000 tonnes of rice in the first half of this year, up by 368.4 percent compared with the same period last year, customs figures showed on Friday.</p>
<p>	 EXPORTS JAN-JUNE     June	YR/YR PCTAGE CHANGE</p>
<p> Rice	360,000	   90,000	+368.4</p>
<p>	 IMPORTS JAN-MAY	MAY</p>
<p>	     140,000	   10,000	- 60.6</p>
<p>Note: Figures given in tonnes</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
</text>
